# 🧵 Jhagra Textile & Clothing — Atelier Ledger

An elegant, lightweight Tkinter desktop application for managing garment tailoring orders, customer measurement cards, staff allocations, and live shop floor execution metrics.

Redesigned with an **Apple Glassmorphic Light Theme** design system featuring clean typography, high contrast, smooth canvas-rendered progress donuts, and an intuitive sidebar navigation layout.

---

## ✨ Features

*  Apple Glass Light UI Design System: Built with modern typography, subtle borders (`#E5E5EA`), light grey background (`#F5F5F7`), and accent color palettes.
* **📊 Analytics Dashboard**:
* **Custom Donut Gauges**: Real-time progress indicators for **Work Done**, **In Progress**, and **Work Remaining**.
* **Active Orders Ledger**: Quick-view table summarizing order IDs, customers, garments, status, and assigned tailors.


* **👤 Customer Hub**: Manage customer contact profiles, measurement cards (length, chest, waist), and order logs.
* **📋 Staff & Task Allocation**: Track employee roles (Master Cutter, Stitching Specialist), duty status, and current assigned benchmark tasks.
* **⚙️ Diagnostics & Settings**: Integrated view for local storage paths, offline Excel engine detection, and backend API status.
* **⏰ Real-time Header Clock**: Live system timestamp updated every second in the top navigation bar.

