## ⚙️ Configuration & API Backend

The application is structured to seamlessly interface with a local REST API backend. By default, API calls are directed to:

```python
API_BASE = 'http://127.0.0.1:5000/api'

```

To connect to your live Flask or FastAPI server, update the `API_BASE` string at the top of `main_gui.py`.